# Two ways lead into the round of b2 and b3: over b1, where `v0 === true` has failed, and from b0 straight into b3. b2 has one forward entry, which carries that v0 is not true; the edge
# from b3 leads back to it and carries nothing: over it `true` arrives. What b2 took is given up: an edge that lets everything through is laid into the join that its uses read.
# RUN: summary f1
# CHECK: edge Parameter 0 -> [[join]]
# CHECK-NOT: passes=undefined|null|false
# CHECK: edge [[join]] -> Contents Element of ClassInstance Array

